      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785920308478,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Terraform:\n- init : To start (it sets up terraform locally) \n- plan : Memory state \n- validation : Syntax check\n- apply : Apply infrastructure in cloud\n- destroy : is to delete resources which are mapped in tfstate file\n- refresh : \n\nadvance lvl : re-configure, -migrate-state ...",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Terraform:\n- init : To start (it sets up terraform locally) \n- plan : Memory state \n- validation : Syntax check\n- apply : Apply infrastructure in cloud\n- destroy : is to delete resources which are mapped in tfstate file\n- refresh : \n\nadvance lvl : re-configure, -migrate-state ...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
