      "updated": 1786184265891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RFC 1989 doc : https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1918",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RFC 1989 doc : https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1918",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "waeVHokRkSnP514Pr5BkB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3465.4593923049456,
      "y": 2080.2175113223384,
      "width": 502.0505239098144,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1544118184,
      "version": 205,
      "versionNonce": 139765928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786184587684,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Amazon reserves the first four and the last one\n(5 total) IP addresses from your CIDR block. \nthese reserved addresses are .0 (network), \n.1 (router), \n.2 (DNS), \n.3 (future use),\n.255 (broadcast)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Amazon reserves the first four and the last one (5 total) IP addresses from your CIDR block. \nthese reserved addresses are .0 (network), \n.1 (router), \n.2 (DNS), \n.3 (future use),\n.255 (broadcast)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QKse6ffk5c2Myc7s9SB-Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3671.1902112485955,
      "y": 2623.922843541035,
      "width": 489.71160888671875,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 262847192,
      "version": 164,
      "versionNonce": 2090772952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786184736547,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The box logic we discussed: the VPC (has in total 64 IPs)\nNow we need to divide this 64 in 'n' number of boxes according\nto our needs.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The box logic we discussed: the VPC (has in total 64 IPs)\nNow we need to divide this 64 in 'n' number of boxes according\nto our needs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
